From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:59:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] portal: provide Gnoblin file chooser with GTK4

Build the portal without the upstream Nautilus file chooser and provide the Gnoblin file chooser with GTK4 in its
place (the overlay src/gnoblin-filechooser.c). The Gnoblin chooser replaces the removed one in the same wiring lines.
---
 src/meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index f1e9f5b..9e5f52f 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -104,7 +104,7 @@ sources = built_sources + files(
   'displaystatetracker.c',
   'dynamic-launcher.c',
   'fc-monitor.c',
-  'filechooser.c',
+  'gnoblin-filechooser.c',
   'inputcapture.c',
   'inputcapturedialog.c',
   'globalshortcuts.c',
-- 
2.55.0

